WEBVTT

00:03:56.899 --> 00:04:00.236
but realize it will take a large
collective effort to get it done.

00:04:03.239 --> 00:04:06.033
So they usually start the community
in a group chat server,

00:04:06.033 --> 00:04:07.868
and the most common is called Discord.

00:04:07.868 --> 00:04:09.829
We use Discord for weekly community calls

00:04:09.829 --> 00:04:12.415
where people can share ideas
and debate proposals.

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:16.544
In the server, channels are set up
around teams and projects.

00:04:16.544 --> 00:04:18.254
Instead of a formal boss,

00:04:18.296 --> 00:04:22.008
each team has an elected facilitator
who holds regular meetings.

00:04:23.342 --> 00:04:26.762
People can contribute to the DAO
full-time, part-time,

00:04:26.804 --> 00:04:29.265
but one of the most common ways
is through bounties,

00:04:29.265 --> 00:04:31.017
where you hop in and out of the DAO,